<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πά̆ν-δεινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all-dreadful,
			terrible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνδεινον ἡ ἀδικία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					610d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				605c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					54.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				212
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνδεινα πεπονθέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Prom.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνδεινόν [ἐστι</span>] it is
				<i>outrageous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.79
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				27.34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.86
			</span></i> W. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>very able</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				290b
			</span></i>; ironically, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.120
			</span></i>.</div>
